identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22352566"
    description: >-
      CITE THIS FOR THE SOFTWARE. The concept DOI of the release archive: it
      resolves to the newest archived release and follows every future one. A
      citation of this DOI reaches the software as released, which the
      priority record below does not.
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21787144"
    description: >-
      THE FIRST DEPOSIT — 2026-08-04, Tsvetan Rouschev — and the priority
      record kept as such: the earliest dated, authored statement of the ℤ/9
      involution approach to the Clay Millennium problems, published before
      any later work on the same ground. It is retained precisely so the date
      and the authorship stand on the public record, independently
      recomputable from the deposit. Its title, "Quantum Proofs of the Clay
      Millennium Problems v1.0", carries claims the author's own 2026-08-20
      audit withdrew — this repository asserts no Clay problem is solved by
      it; see the abstract above and HONESTY.md. Cited for PRIORITY and
      attribution, not as proof, and not for its title. NOTE its concept DOI
      (10.5281/zenodo.21787143) is shared with two unrelated works and now
      resolves to the uuidna record, so cite this VERSION DOI and never that
      concept.
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21781603"
    description: >-
      The author's initial publication of 2026-08-04: "All Seven Clay
      Millennium Problems Sealed via Universal σ-Involution" (Tsvetan
      Rouschev, ORCID 0009-0000-7312-9778). Concept DOI
      10.5281/zenodo.21781602, which resolves to the newest version.
